stichera.text:
A day of splendid festivity hath dawned;
the angels join chorus in heaven;
mortals rejoice on earth;
and the whole assembly of the Church is glad,
glorifying God Who is wondrous in His saints,
Who hath revealed the holy hierarch Pitirim
as a new wonderworker and intercessor for the Russian land.

